# Shrimp And Avocado

Based on [https://www.geniuskitchen.com/recipe/…](https://www.geniuskitchen.com/recipe/avocado-and-shrimp-sushi-331300) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20181216131319/https://www.geniuskitchen.com/recipe/avocado-and-shrimp-sushi-331300))

