## Ingredients

- [ ] [cooked shrimp]{ ing="cooked-shrimp" }
- [ ] [cucumber]{ ing="cucumber" }
- [ ] 1/5 [avocado]{ ing="avocado" }, peeled and mashed
- [ ] 1 Tbsps fresh [cilantro]{ ing="cilantro" }, finely chopped
- [ ] [chives]{ ing="chives" }
- [ ] [sushi rice]{ ing="sushi-rice" }
- [ ] [wasabi]{ ing="wasabi" }
- [ ] [nori]{ ing="nori" }

## Recipe

1. Spread [rice]{ ing="sushi-rice" } over the [nori]{ ing="nori" }, then with rice-side up, add the fillings. Roll
